$N$ is the set of people who subscribe to Netflix and $S$ is the set of people who subscribe to Stan.
Which diagram shows the region $N' \cap S$ shaded?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (8,4.6);
\draw (3,2.3) circle (1.7);
\draw (5,2.3) circle (1.7);
\node[anchor=north west, font=\small] at (0.15,4.5) {$\xi$};
\node at (1.9,4.15) {$R$};
\node at (6.1,4.15) {$A$};
\node at (2.15,2.3) {$15$};
\node at (4,2.3) {$8$};
\node at (5.85,2.3) {$19$};
\node at (7.3,0.5) {$6$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The Venn diagram shows the $48$ members of a school sports club, where $R$ is the set of members in the rowing squad and $A$ is the set of members in the athletics squad.
How many members are in $R \cup A$?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (8,4.6);
\draw (3,2.3) circle (1.7);
\draw (5,2.3) circle (1.7);
\node[anchor=north west, font=\small] at (0.15,4.5) {$\xi$};
\node at (1.9,4.15) {$P$};
\node at (6.1,4.15) {$Y$};
\node at (2.15,2.3) {$24$};
\node at (4,2.3) {$15$};
\node at (5.85,2.3) {$?$};
\node at (7.3,0.5) {$13$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
A community centre has $72$ members.
$P$ is the set of members in the pottery class and $Y$ is the set of members in the yoga class.
One region of the Venn diagram has not been filled in.
How many members are in $P' \cap Y$?
